WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:14.580
Saying yes wasn't hard.

2
00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.340
Besides, I owed you a promise.

3
00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.300
Go mingle.

4
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.510
I'll grab us some drinks.

5
00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:40.810
He's just your friend.

6
00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:41.510
He is!

7
00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.300
Then why am I always second to him?

8
00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.880
I never meant to hurt you.

9
00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:49.170
Yet you allow him slutting around you.

10
00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:56.170
Yes. I did have feelings for Chris.

11
00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:58.900
But that doesn't give you the
right to downgrading someone.

12
00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:03.360
And Chris, if loving me means
hurting her, then hear me clearly.

13
00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:05.680
I'm not allowing myself
to make enemies of it.

14
00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:18.560
Theo, wait!

15
00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:20.950
What about you?

16
00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:24.240
Didn't you hurt someone after kissing them?

17
00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:27.480
Then hate me all you want, Raymond.

18
00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:30.350
Stop!
